# Walk for the SLEIC_FORCE_FAULT captures that need a real credit and a real serve
# attempt (task 18): eeprom, wrongbios (both boot-time hangs that fire before the
# coin/START presses matter, so this script is harmless overkill for them, but one
# script for all three keeps the recipe uniform) and ball-out-error (which needs an
# actual 0xE9 serve request for the exit-contact probe to have anything to jam).
# The solenoid/flipper self-test probes (solenoid-short, solenoid-cut,
# flipper-broken) and ball-missing use the narrower
# scripts/keyscripts/iomoon-faults-attract.keys instead -- see
# iomoon-faults-attract.keys's own header for why.
#
# Keys: KEYCODE_1 START, KEYCODE_5 COIN (src/wpc/sims/sleic/iomoon.c, simulation.txt).
    40 mark boot
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
   200 mark credit
   200 tap 8 KEYCODE_5
   260 mark ball-1-start
   260 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  4000 mark settle
  4100 quit
